propsSchema.description:
Sandboxed HTML with $param_name and {{udf_name}} substitution. Exposes window.fused: fused.env ("workbench"); fused.params.get(name) / .getAll() / .set(name, value) / .set({...}) / .set(name, null) to clear / .onChange(cb), backed by canvas params so connected nodes and $param placeholders react; and await fused.runPython(udfName, params) to run a connected canvas UDF and get its JSON result.

## Example

```json
{
  "type": "html",
  "props": {
    "value": "<h2>Hello, $user_name!</h2><p>Selected city: <b>$city</b></p>"
  }
}
```
